      "nodeType": "claim",
      "title": "Two-removal rigidity of the specified embedded G_76 configurations",
      "summary": "For each specified embedding, removing two embedded points frees at most one originally outside cell. Exactly 16 removal pairs free a cell, distributed over four cells with four pairs per cell, and every freeing uses the reported two-lines-of-two mechanism. Removal depth three or greater is not addressed.",
