      "nodeType": "lemma",
      "title": "Distance constraint from the specified embedded G_76 152-point configurations",
      "summary": "For each specified embedding E, any no-three-in-line set S with at most two removals from E has at most one addition and size at most 152. Consequently, every such set of size at least 153 requires at least three removals and four additions relative to every specified embedding, hence symmetric-difference distance at least seven. This is a local constraint, not a global impossibility result.",
      "reportSection": "## Node: no-three-in-line/d77-distance-from-embedded-g76-152-record",
